{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":38,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["希西家王的疾病和痊癒"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時希西家病得要死，亞摩斯的兒子先知以賽亞去見他，對他說：「耶和華如此說：你當留遺命與你的家，因為你必死不能活了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西家就轉臉朝牆，禱告耶和華說："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「耶和華啊，求你記念我在你面前怎樣存完全的心，按誠實行事，又做你眼中所看為善的。」希西家就痛哭了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華的話臨到以賽亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「你去告訴希西家說，耶和華－你祖大衛的上帝如此說：我聽見了你的禱告，看見了你的眼淚。我必加增你十五年的壽數；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["並且我要救你和這城脫離亞述王的手，也要保護這城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「我－耶和華必成就我所說的。我先給你一個兆頭，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["就是叫亞哈斯的日晷，向前進的日影往後退十度。」於是，前進的日影果然在日晷上往後退了十度。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"猶大王希西家患病已經痊癒，就作詩說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說：正在我中年","poem":1},{"noteId":33},{"text":"之日","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必進入陰間的門；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我餘剩的年歲不得享受。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說：我必不得見耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在活人之地不見耶和華；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與世上的居民不再見面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的住處被遷去離開我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像牧人的帳棚一樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我將性命捲起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像織布的捲布一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必將我從機頭剪斷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從早到晚，他要使我完結。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使自己安靜直到天亮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像獅子折斷我一切的骨頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從早到晚，他要使我完結。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"我像燕子呢喃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像白鶴鳴叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像鴿子哀鳴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因仰觀，眼睛困倦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我受欺壓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你為我作保。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可說甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他應許我的，也給我成就了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因心裏的苦楚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在一生的年日必悄悄而行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"主啊，人得存活乃在乎此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我靈存活也全在此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以求你使我痊癒，仍然存活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我受大苦，本為使我得平安；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因愛我的靈魂","poem":1},{"noteId":34},{"text":"便救我脫離敗壞的坑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你將我一切的罪扔在你的背後。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"原來，陰間不能稱謝你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死亡不能頌揚你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下坑的人不能盼望你的誠實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有活人，活人必稱謝你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像我今日稱謝你一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為父的，必使兒女知道你的誠實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和華肯救我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我們要一生一世","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在耶和華殿中","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用絲弦的樂器唱我的詩歌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["以賽亞說：「當取一塊無花果餅來，貼在瘡上，王必痊癒。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["希西家問說：「我能上耶和華的殿，有甚麼兆頭呢？」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":33,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：晌午","reference":{"chapter":38,"verse":10}},{"noteId":34,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：生命","reference":{"chapter":38,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/38.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/39.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/37.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}